WEBVTT

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.530
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:34.280
ARYIROS

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:48.920
The Caravan Daughter

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.170
Three Great Merchants
Rahmonov Castello

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:51.880
Moving forward,

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:56.220
I would like the Torqye Pashalu to focus on
trade relations with the East as well.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.260
As one of the Three Great Merchants,

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:02.220
can we count on your cooperation,
Lord Rahmonov?

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.390
Are you aware, Mahmut Pasha,

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.810
that this city was built by merchants

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.440
and is like one big marketplace?

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.990
It's a place we all treasure.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:20.570
I can't very well get it involved in some foreign war.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.660
I won't ask what you've come here to do,

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.410
but we can't very well have rumors spreading

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.750
that one of the Three Great Merchants

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:31.460
lent their support to Torqye.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.500
We cannot offer you any help,

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.420
or issue you any notes.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:40.300
I am very sorry, but I ask that you leave.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.550
Well, that was a waste of time.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:47.430
If a note dealer won't issue you a note,
we can't do anything in this city.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:50.940
If that is the attitude
of one of the Three Great Merchants,

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:55.940
we could probably safely assume that there isn't
anybody in this city that will support us.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:00.360
-Hey!
-Stop right there.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.030
Hanum Niki! We've paid you the money.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.870
You have to leave the items with us.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.080
You can have your money back.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.880
Sir, our companies have been in business together
for over 30 years.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:19.720
So explain why you're severing our relationship
after this deal.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:23.050
Hanum Niki of the Bahram Caravan?

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:28.850
Idris Caravan will be doing business with this
establishment from now on.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:33.520
Idris! You weren't content with stealing our camel riders,
you had to steal our business too?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.070
And all of you! Have you forgotten what
my father did for you?

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:41.240
How could you quit and work for the competition
as soon as he died!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.320
Dear me. This is the problem with children.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.240
Hanum Niki.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.500
Are you saying that you're able
to guarantee their jobs?

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.290
They worked for your father.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:56.500
They didn't work for you.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:01.130
Just because you may have taken over
your father's note dealing business,

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.550
doesn't mean you have the right to tie them down.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:10.850
If you're going to blame anyone,
blame your old man for dying before you were ready.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.980
Oh, is that right?

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:19.280
So that's why you feel like you can take my father's
trade deals and camel riders

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.240
without having to work at all!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.700
Stop, Hanum Niki!

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.200
Stay out of this! I've only got business with him!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.700
Hold her hands!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.870
Let go of me!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.210
Throwing a tantrum won't do you any good.

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:35.580
Who is going to trust and do business with a child

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.300
who only became a note dealer through her
father's accomplishments?

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.470
Let her go.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.880
Let's go.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:51.060
Not one of you are going to come with me?

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.060
I see.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:07.570
As a wholesale store, we can't make deals with someone
with no experience.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:11.040
The Eastern trade routes are plagued
by bandits and animals.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:15.330
Try traveling the route by yourself.
You'll see how foolish you sound.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.040
Us? Be your camel riders?

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.420
You've gotta be kidding.
We don't want to die.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.300
Come back when you turn 20.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:27.800
There is no place for me in this city anymore.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:31.640
I was a part of their group just yesterday.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.930
Is there no future for me as a merchant?

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:38.230
Why is it just me?

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:43.900
Am I not allowed to live my life here
after my father's passing?

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:02.800
If you're giving up,
perhaps you would consider joining me first.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.210
I don't know what your scam is,

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.880
but I'm not falling for that!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.760
If you're willing to accept the dangers
and join forces with me,

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.440
then I will get you back your rightful place.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.440
Torqyery?

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:23.110
I am the Torqye Pashalu's Minister of Foreign Affairs,

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.360
Tughril Mahmut Pasha.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.070
You're a politician from the Torqye Pashalu?

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:33.870
I will be doing business in Aryiros
that will change the world.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:38.000
In order to do that,
I will need the help of a note dealer.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.080
How are you going to change the world?

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.630
What if I told you

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:46.050
that the ship I came in
is carrying 30 camels' worth of these.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.260
What did you say?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:53.510
If you follow the conventions of this city
and decline my proposal,

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:56.020
then I won't be able to tell you anymore.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:01.440
If it were discovered that a note dealer
worked with a foreign politician,

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:05.730
I would be stripped of my license,
and banned from the city.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.110
But...

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:10.450
I have no reason to honor this city's rules.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:14.240
Not to the people who cast me aside.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.410
I can't just sit here and do nothing.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:28.460
Then come with us.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.880
Step right up!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:37.010
We've got a brand-new caravan
specializing in luxury goods!

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.890
Great deals here at the Niki Caravan!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:53.070
You'd better have a good explanation for this,
Mahmut Pasha.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.160
Rahmonov knows who we are.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.040
As long as we carry the name
of the Torqye Pashalu,

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:02.120
we should conceal our
identities when in public.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:05.330
Welcome! Feel free to come in for a closer look!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:10.800
You won't find a better opportunity to check out
so much Torqyery in one place!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:15.510
It's really impressive how much Abiriga
has taken to his role as a woman.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.760
He's a bit large to be totally
convincing as a woman.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:23.190
Are there any wholesale stores
that want to do business with us?

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:24.350
-Three thousand!
-Five thousand!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:26.560
-Us! Sell to us!
-Six thousand!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.230
Well, then, please register your names here.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.190
Is that Hanum Niki?

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.240
That is a bold move.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.950
She's already started a new business
after what happened yesterday.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.410
As expected of Bahram's only daughter.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:45.370
This is the world I've entered after betraying Aryiros.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:50.000
That's why I can't return to my old life.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.590
But, I...

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.930
I will follow this man...

00:08:55.550 --> 00:09:01.470
to see a world no merchant in Aryiros
has ever seen before.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.440
This is where the real work begins.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:10.980
There are a number of trade routes
that run from Aryiros to the East.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:14.650
However, the only ones allowed to deal
with the major Eastern nation of Chinili

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.410
are Rahmonov and the Three Great Merchants.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.370
Would it be possible for us
to enter the market as well?

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:22.700
That's going to be difficult.

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:27.460
Their monopoly of the direct trading rights
is what's sustaining their power.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:31.630
Anybody who would threaten that
gets thrown out of this city without exception.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.630
Why do you want to do business with Chinili?

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.680
Because Chinili is prosperous,

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:39.100
and the furthest nation from Rumeriana.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:44.930
In order to have foreign nations believe that this
business we are about to start is unrelated to Torqye,

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.850
having their attention turned to the Far East
would be best.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:52.570
Hey, I think I actually know someone from Chinili.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:56.650
He's not a note dealer,
but used to be someone important in Chinili.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:01.990
There's an old man that buys unusual items
from Rumeriana for the emperor of Chinili.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.950
He's been really good to me since I was little.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.620
Could you tell us more?

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:12.460
Oh, Niki! It's so good to see you again!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.590
Come on in.
I'm sure my husband will be thrilled to see you.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.430
No! You mustn't!

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:22.560
Nothing beats a good stroll after a bath.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:26.140
Sir! Please put some clothes on!

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:29.230
We have guests.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.690
Hi, there, Niki. Long time no see.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:34.730
Are they new hires for the Bahram Caravan?

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.820
No, I've started a new caravan of my own.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.450
Let me introduce you guys.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:43.660
This is Master Wang Yixin from Chinili.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.500
So Bahram has passed on?

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:54.210
That is sad to hear.
I've known him since I first came to this city.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:59.430
Master Wang was sent here by the emperor of Chinili
20 years ago.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:04.310
I heard that you were the captain
of the emperor's personal guard before that.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.350
That was a long time ago.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.680
After I injured my leg in battle,

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.440
I retired to this city,

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:13.980
selecting items to present to the emperor.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.440
I do not have any official license,

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:21.860
but I was given special permission
from the Three Great Merchants

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:26.240
to freely purchase anything under the stipulation
that the items are only sent to Chinili.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:29.410
That's why we came here to talk to you today.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.370
Please, have a look.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.580
Venedician glass.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:37.210
I've sent similar items to the emperor in the past.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:41.180
I would like to sell these to Chinili.
In units of 10,000.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.930
What is he talking about?

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:47.680
They might be valuable, but they're not especially rare.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:51.390
If that is what you're interested in,
you've come to the wrong person.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:55.480
If you want to do business with Chinili directly,
you should take this to the Three--

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.440
Master Wang, please consider this carefully.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:01.950
We are not the only ones who stand to benefit
from this deal.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.200
Think of the benefits it could bring you as well.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.040
What are you suggesting that I will gain?

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.540
The ire of Rahmonov
for threatening his vested interests?

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:18.960
For bringing your beloved emperor
what you worked so hard in your first life to give him.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.170
Peace for Chinili.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:30.850
I just remembered that the crown prince is
celebrating his coming of age ceremony next year.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:36.190
I don't believe they've chosen the item
they will bestow upon the people yet.

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:40.030
And it must be Venedician glass?

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.320
Yes.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:42.780
Very well.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:46.870
We shall purchase 400,000 boxes of Venedician glass
from Niki Caravan.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.410
-Four--
-Dear!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:54.040
I shall look forward to seeing how these glasses

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.920
will bring about peace.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.000
What in the world is going on?

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:06.300
Are you sure about making such a promise
without giving it much consideration, dear?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:09.970
It's fine. Balt-Rhein is trouble.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.680
Balt-Rhein?

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.270
Merchant city-states like Aryiros and Venedik

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:19.230
do not desire territory as long as they have
a market to do business with.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:24.860
However, nations with agriculture and animal husbandry
at their foundation, such as Chinili and Balt-Rhein,

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.910
are inclined to expand their territory
at every opportunity.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:32.910
It is only a matter of time
before Chinili must fight them.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:36.960
But that boy from Torqye
is suggesting he can prevent that.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.960
Boy? That is no way to speak
about a young lady.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.420
That was no girl.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.710
What?

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.380
That was no merchant either.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.260
Those were hands of a soldier.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:47.890
A patriotic cause,

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.970
justified by my duty to my lord...

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:54.480
How could I refuse him when he presents me
with a proposal that satisfies both?

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:58.600
That brash kid tested me.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:04.030
In any case, that was a pretty understanding old man.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:09.570
It simply means that Master Wang was also
someone who dedicated his life to his country.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.950
I'm not following at all.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.410
They're here.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:22.000
I leave the rest to you,
Great Merchant Niki Al-Bahram.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:24.210
Don't worry, I can take it from here.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:27.630
Take the first shipment to Jamal Caravan's camels.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:31.680
The second shipment goes to Akhtal Caravan.
The third cargo goes to Ali Caravan.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:36.770
I suppose there is nothing to be done if they are for
the crown prince's coming of age ceremony.

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:39.940
I never expected matters to get so out of hand.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.730
Please forgive me, Lord Rahmonov.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:47.280
That's not necessary, it is a fitting opportunity
to strengthen trade relations with the East.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:51.820
This will only bolster the reputation of our city.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:55.450
The seventh shipment hasn't arrived?
What do you mean?

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.040
The glass pieces have arrived,

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:02.170
but the cushioning for the boxes
wasn't prepared in time.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.590
You couldn't avoid the glares, just as I thought.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:07.840
It doesn't matter.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:14.810
We have given our homeland,
which we shall never see again, some insurance.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:17.560
Do they mean straw when they say cushioning?

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:22.520
That's right. Apparently, there's a shortage
of the high quality straw used for packaging.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:27.440
It appears we've hit a snag in the most unlikely of places.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:33.910
Now we should be able to comfortably watch
as the carpet is pulled right from under Balt-Rhein.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.330
What?

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:39.370
Again, I have no idea what's going on.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.870
Venedik

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:46.090
Deploy all our fastest vessels to the grain-producing
areas around the Centro!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.170
Bring back 200,000 boxes of straw

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.300
to the ports of Venedik within 15 days!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:52.840
I'm counting on you, Brega.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.350
Whatever may happen,

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:59.180
Venedik stakes our reputation
on honoring our contracts.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:04.980
That is why friendly nations are able to have
a tremendous amount of trust in our contracts.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:11.070
That truth has made Venedik the greatest
merchant city-state in the Centro.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:12.950
Yes, my Doge.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:14.700
Tharros

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.580
We would like Tharros to sell its wheat to our nation.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:21.580
-We will pay five times the normal amount.
-Five times?

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:22.790
King of Tharros
Muwanaidi III

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.750
Your Highness, we mustn't.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.210
That wheat is meant for the Empire.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:32.050
Capitan Brega, the wheat has yet to be processed.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.760
It would take at least seven days
to thresh the wheat to produce the straw.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:39.060
We will thresh it ourselves during transport.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.980
Would you sell the threshing tools to us as well?

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:46.400
What excuse are you planning on giving the Empire?

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:50.860
Don't worry.
It's not as if we have a contract with the Empire.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.990
We are talking five times the market price.
Five times!

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.200
Balt-Rhein Empire
Castle Michael

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.320
Tharros sold their wheat to Venedik?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.580
It seems like this throws off your calculations, Louis.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:05.500
You were planning to fuel your invasion of Torqye
with the wheat from Tharros, weren't you?

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:08.460
After all the trouble you went through

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.880
inciting civil unrest to weaken Torqye,

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.340
this will cause you to miss the opportunity.

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:15.590
Send up the signal flare.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:19.350
Have the fleet stationed in Phoinike
secure the wheat from Tharros.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:23.640
Venedik is a cunning enemy,
but Law can handle the situation.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:24.810
Yes, sir!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:28.860
This is what happens when you're too lenient
with these countries.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:34.070
You should forget diplomacy
and annex all key locations into our territory.

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:38.530
Yes, I shall consider that in the future.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:43.250
But why did the wheat market move now?

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.040
Is it just a coincidence?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.670
Phoinike

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.170
They have not given us easy orders.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:53.050
They always carry out their business deals
to the very end.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.670
That is the Venedik way.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.260
They are not the type of people
who will just hand over their cargo.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.640
What is the meaning of this lethargic pace?

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.100
We need to hurry!

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:10.060
Captain, could we say that we
simply didn't see the signal flare?

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:16.280
The Empire has managed to forge a positive relationship
with Venedik even after leveling Phoinike.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.740
And now I must destroy that with my own hands?

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.660
Our orders are absolute!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:26.370
If this is your attitude, as a servant of the Empire,
I will have no choice but to report you!

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:31.340
Good grief, this is far from what I want to be doing.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.840
Venedician Fleet, lower your sails!

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:44.010
You carry cargo that was originally meant to be delivered
to our imperial ports!

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.560
We will refund your payment in full!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.480
We ask that you surrender your cargo!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.940
-Reply using nautical signals.
-Yes, Captain!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:58.070
If there has been a mistake,
take it up with the Republic of Venedik, not me.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.160
As long as my orders stand,

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.370
I cannot sell back the cargo I hold.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.370
Naturally.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:07.410
I will take full responsibility.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:13.920
Please reply that we will accompany
their fleet back to Venedik.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.590
Yes, Admiral!

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.670
Does Admiral Law intend to yield
to the enemy's demands?

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:23.470
What shall we do? The Venedician Fleet
is showing no signs of stopping.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:27.470
Charge forward! We will stop the Venedician Fleet
by force if we have to!

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:35.020
What is he doing? Pull back!

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:41.700
You fool.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.620
A few days later,

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:48.410
word of the clash between
the Venedician and Balt-Rhein navies

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:52.170
as well as the capture of Admiral Ryan Law,
reached the other nations.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.250
The harbor is full of rumors about some incident!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.960
Apparently, it had something to do
with the Venedician glass we bought.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.630
Is this what you were aiming for, Pasha?

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.800
The Empire won't be able to strike a campaign
without the wheat from the fall harvest.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.350
Nice.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:11.560
And all it cost us was the price of the Torqyery.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:16.400
Economic power is no different from military power.
It is something that should be preserved.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:20.400
If we're able to stop the Empire's progress
without costing us power,

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.360
we could ask for nothing more.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:26.950
But that is not all you were aiming for, Padrone.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:31.330
It was to pit Venedik
and Balt-Rhein against each other.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.830
I would hazard to guess

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:37.090
that Venedik has become
the greatest obstacle Balt-Rhein must face.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:41.130
And Venedik should have concluded that Balt-Rhein
is a dangerous nation

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:44.430
who would disregard the rules of the Centro
without hesitation.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.720
Wonderfully done.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.220
Now both nations have become each other's enemy,

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:54.560
and Torqye has successfully gained
a new ally in Venedik.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:59.020
Beansprout, you're going to sit there impressed
after your own country got used like that?

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.940
That is just how Venedicians are.

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.110
Even if our own country is used,

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:07.530
if it is done skillfully, we praise it without prejudice.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:12.450
Well, that's good of you.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.710
You give me too much credit.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:18.920
This plan only came together
because we met Niki by chance.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.340
Thank you.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:25.590
Now, Torqye has been given valuable time
to prepare against the Empire.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:29.760
I'm not sure exactly how much I was able to do,

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:33.020
but I had fun working with you.

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:35.230
I want to express my gratitude as well.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.730
Thanks! But things got a little too big this time.

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:41.480
It's only a matter of time

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.200
before the Three Great Merchants
discover the identity of the Niki Caravan.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:48.530
I won't be able to stay in this city anymore.

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:51.910
I used you.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.370
Yet...

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:57.040
It was my own decision to back you.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:00.210
But thanks to that, I got a glimpse of the outside world.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:05.010
If I stick with you, I'm sure that I'll see
many more wondrous things.

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:10.640
Will you show me a world
I've never seen before, Mahmut?

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:13.100
Happily.

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:52.910
The people starve, and a stench lingers in the air.
Urado's days are numbered.

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:56.080
No, Your Majesty! It is not over yet!

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:58.160
Next time, "The Northern Kingdom."

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:01.670
Please save our country, Pasha.
